# Production: the SPA is served from https://demo.ambot365.com and the API from
# a different host, so every request needs an absolute base URL. This value is
# baked into the bundle at build time by `npm run build` — changing it requires
# a rebuild, not just a redeploy.
#
# No trailing slash. Scheme and host must match exactly what the API allows in
# Cors:AllowedOrigins, or the browser will block every response.
#
# This file holds no secrets: anything Vite exposes ends up readable in the
# shipped JavaScript by design.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://demoapi.ambot365.com
